{
 "title": "Spain",
 "sections": [
  {
   "title": "Spain",
   "card": false,
   "beats": [
    {
     "id": "c025",
     "shot": "sp_cabrillo",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "1542. A captain named Cabrillo sails up the coast for Spain.",
     "date": null,
     "amb": "waves",
     "sfx": [
      [
       "tick",
       0,
       0.5
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "c026",
     "shot": "sp_cabrillo",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "He's the first European to see it.",
     "date": null,
     "amb": "waves"
    },
    {
     "id": "c027",
     "shot": "sp_react",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "And Spain's reaction?",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c028",
     "shot": "sp_react",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "Nice. We'll get back to you.",
     "date": null,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "boing",
       "w:Nice.",
       0.5
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "c029",
     "shot": "sp_wait",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "They did.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c030",
     "shot": "sp_wait",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "*227* years later.",
     "date": null,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "ticks",
       0,
       0.5
      ],
      [
       "stamp",
       "w:later.",
       0.7
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "c031",
     "shot": "sp_drake",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "In between, the English sea captain Francis Drake stopped by in 1579.",
     "date": null,
     "amb": "waves"
    },
    {
     "id": "c032",
     "shot": "sp_drake",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "He fixed his ship, claimed the whole place for his queen, and left.",
     "date": null,
     "amb": "waves",
     "sfx": [
      [
       "pop",
       "w:claimed",
       0.5
      ],
      [
       "whoosh",
       "w:left.",
       0.5
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "c033",
     "shot": "sp_woke",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "So what finally woke Spain up?",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c034",
     "shot": "sp_woke",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "*Russia.*",
     "date": null,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "slam",
       "w:Russia.",
       0.6
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "c035",
     "shot": "sp_russia",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "Russian fur hunters were creeping down from Alaska,",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c036",
     "shot": "sp_russia",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "and suddenly that quiet coast looked worth keeping.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c037",
     "shot": "sp_missions",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "So in 1769, soldiers and priests marched north.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c038",
     "shot": "sp_missions",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "Over the next 54 years, they built *21* missions,",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c039",
     "shot": "sp_missions",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "from San Diego to Sonoma, linked by one road. El Camino Real, the Royal Road.",
     "date": null,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "ding",
       "w:Royal",
       0.4
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "c040",
     "shot": "sp_cities",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "San Diego.",
     "date": null,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "swish",
       0,
       0.5
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "c041",
     "shot": "sp_cities",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "Santa Barbara. San Francisco.",
     "date": null,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "swish",
       0,
       0.5
      ],
      [
       "swish",
       "w:San",
       0.5
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "c042",
     "shot": "sp_cities",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "Every one of those cities began as a mission.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c043",
     "shot": "sp_cities",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "You have been reading Spain's to-do list on road signs your *whole* life.",
     "date": null,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "kaching",
       "w:to-do",
       0.4
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "c044",
     "shot": "sp_walls",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "But inside the mission walls, it was a different story.",
     "date": null,
     "quiet": true
    },
    {
     "id": "c045",
     "shot": "sp_walls",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "Native families were brought in to work and to pray.",
     "date": null,
     "quiet": true
    },
    {
     "id": "c046",
     "shot": "sp_walls",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "Many were not free to leave, and the diseases that came with the newcomers",
     "date": null,
     "quiet": true
    },
    {
     "id": "c047",
     "shot": "sp_walls",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "moved faster than any priest.",
     "date": null,
     "quiet": true
    },
    {
     "id": "c048",
     "shot": "sp_walls",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "Tens of thousands died.",
     "date": null,
     "quiet": true
    },
    {
     "id": "c049",
     "shot": "sp_rush1",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "Rush number one was for souls and for empire.",
     "date": null,
     "quiet": true
    },
    {
     "id": "c050",
     "shot": "sp_rush1",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "It would not be the last.",
     "date": null,
     "quiet": true
    }
   ]
  }
 ]
}